<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Station Casinos downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Station Casinos downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said Wednesday it downgraded its rating and trimmed earnings estimates of Station Casinos Inc based on continued difficulty in estimating the potential of the company's Missouri casino.</p>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw said it downgraded Station Casinos' rating to a neutral from a buy and lowered its fiscal 1998 earnings estimate to $0.55 a share from $0.82, and fiscal 1999 to $0.85 from $0.95.</p>
<p>Shares of Station Casinos were trading off 3/8 to 8-5/8.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
